%[text] ## Learning Objective
%[text] Upon completion of this activity, the student will be able to configure and execute a temporal simulation of the Carnot cycle for an ideal gas in MATLAB, identifying and describing its four thermodynamic processes through volume and pressure plots as well as a $P-V$ diagram. Furthermore, the student will calculate the cumulative work over at least three consecutive cycles using numerical integration and compare this result with the theoretical value, with the aim of interpreting the temporal evolution of energy transformations within a thermodynamic system.
